    "message": "Transport exact physical cell shifts through the canonical cyclic coordinate\n\nProve physical inverse coordinates, zero and spatial plus/minus1, arbitrary whole-cell theta translations and exact literal-subtype subtraction. Cancel the shared2011 factor from both representatives and modulus rather than assuming coprimality or a modular inverse.\n\nBind the independently defined spatial/temporal source bases in focused checks, retain arbitrary large shifts and N1, and expose scaled nonzero-stride equivalence. Record independent full-source review, fresh direct module/check replay and seventeen standard-only axiom audits for the marked-word adapter.",
